 {
  "id": "9205622d89",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hm-section hm-capabilities\" id=\"home-services\"><div class=\"hm-wrap\">\n      <p class=\"hm-kicker hm-svc-kicker\" data-svc-reveal=\"up\">One team, six disciplines</p>\n      <h2 class=\"hm-svc-title\" data-svc-reveal=\"up\">Design services that cover the whole space</h2>\n      <hr class=\"hm-svc-rule\" data-svc-reveal=\"rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"hm-svc-cols\">\n        <div class=\"hm-svc-grid\">\n          <a class=\"hm-service-card\" href=\"/interior-design/\" data-page-route=\"interior\" data-svc-reveal=\"card\"><small>01 · Plan</small><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 25 25 6M10 6l4 4-5 5-4-4 5-5Zm11 11 5 5-4 4-5-5 4-4Z\"></path></svg><h3>Interior Design</h3><p>Layouts, finishes, furniture and lighting planned as one interior.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n          <a class=\"hm-service-card\" href=\"/fit-out/\" data-page-route=\"fitout-hub\" data-svc-reveal=\"card\"><small>02 · Build</small><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7 24 10-10m-4-5 4-4 6 6-4 4m-8 5 3 3-5 3-1-1 3-5Z\"></path></svg><h3>Fit-Out</h3><p>Every trade coordinated from empty shell to finished space.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n          <a class=\"hm-service-card\" href=\"/renovation/\" data-page-route=\"renovation\" data-svc-reveal=\"card\"><small>03 · Renew</small><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 11 10-5 10 5-10 5-10-5Zm0 5 10 5 10-5M6 21l10 5 10-5\"></path></svg><h3>Renovation</h3><p>Existing homes and businesses reworked with controlled disruption.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n          <a class=\"hm-service-card\" href=\"/architecture/\" data-page-route=\"architecture\" data-svc-reveal=\"card\"><small>04 · Form</small><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 27V10l10-5 10 5v17M11 27V14h10v13M14 18h4\"></path></svg><h3>Architecture</h3><p>Building concepts, elevations and construction-ready drawings.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n          <a class=\"hm-service-card\" href=\"/3d-visualization/\" data-page-route=\"studio\" data-svc-reveal=\"card\"><small>05 · See</small><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 4 11 6v12l-11 6-11-6V10l11-6Zm0 0v12m11-6-11 6-11-6m11 6v12\"></path></svg><h3>3D Studio</h3><p>Photorealistic renders, walkthroughs and virtual tours made in house.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n          <a class=\"hm-service-card\" href=\"https://woodexfurniture.pk\" data-svc-reveal=\"card\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><small>06 · Make</small><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 8h22v16H5zM5 14h22M16 14v10M10 19h2m8 0h2\"></path></svg><h3>Furniture</h3><p>Custom kitchens, wardrobes, office furniture and precise joinery.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n        </div>\n        <aside class=\"hm-svc-side\" data-svc-reveal=\"side\">\n          <p class=\"hm-svc-lede\">From planning and visualisation to site execution and custom furniture, every stage works toward the same brief.</p>\n          <ul class=\"hm-svc-points\">\n            <li>One accountable team for design, build and furniture</li>\n            <li>200+ completed spaces across four cities</li>\n            <li>In-house 3D studio and furniture workshop</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a class=\"hm-btn hm-btn-light\" href=\"#home-services\">Explore all services</a>\n        </aside>\n      </div>\n    </div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "516fc7866a",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hm-section hm-journey\" id=\"home-journey\"><div class=\"hm-wrap\">\n      <header class=\"hm-section-head\" data-home-reveal=\"\"><div><p class=\"hm-kicker\">One connected practice</p><h2>The complete spatial journey, under one roof</h2></div><p>Choose the service you need now, or keep the same team from first idea to handover.</p></header>\n      <div class=\"hm-carousel\" data-home-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"hm-journey-viewport\"><div class=\"hm-journey-track\" id=\"hm-journey-track\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px,0,0);\">\n        <a class=\"hm-journey-card\" href=\"/interior-design/\" data-page-route=\"interior\"><figure class=\"hm-journey-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-c349a92a4ae0.webp\" alt=\"Warm contemporary living room representing Woodex interior design\" width=\"2240\" height=\"1120\"></figure><div class=\"hm-journey-body\"><small>Interior Design</small><h3>Start with how the space should feel and work.</h3><p>Planning, materials, lighting and furniture resolved before construction.</p><span class=\"hm-journey-link\">Explore service →</span></div></a>\n        <a class=\"hm-journey-card\" href=\"/fit-out/\" data-page-route=\"fitout-hub\"><figure class=\"hm-journey-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" alt=\"Contemporary office representing Woodex fit-out delivery\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"hm-journey-body\"><small>Fit-Out</small><h3>Turn the approved plan into a finished interior.</h3><p>Partitions, services, finishes, joinery and furniture under one programme.</p><span class=\"hm-journey-link\">Explore service →</span></div></a>\n        <a class=\"hm-journey-card\" href=\"/renovation/\" data-page-route=\"renovation\"><figure class=\"hm-journey-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" alt=\"Wide office interior representing a coordinated renovation\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"hm-journey-body\"><small>Renovation</small><h3>Give an existing space a clear second life.</h3><p>Condition, phasing and upgrades planned around continued use.</p><span class=\"hm-journey-link\">Explore service →</span></div></a>\n        <a class=\"hm-journey-card\" href=\"/architecture/\" data-page-route=\"architecture\"><figure class=\"hm-journey-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-dce06249b137.webp\" alt=\"Contemporary residence representing Woodex architecture\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"hm-journey-body\"><small>Architecture</small><h3>Shape the building before the rooms.</h3><p>Plans, elevations, approvals and drawings made ready for construction.</p><span class=\"hm-journey-link\">Explore service →</span></div></a>\n        <a class=\"hm-journey-card\" href=\"/3d-visualization/\" data-page-route=\"studio\"><figure class=\"hm-journey-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Retail visualization representing Woodex 3D Studio\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"hm-journey-body\"><small>3D Studio</small><h3>See the space clearly before it is built.</h3><p>4K renders, walkthroughs and virtual tours with two revision rounds.</p><span class=\"hm-journey-link\">Explore service →</span></div></a>\n        <a class=\"hm-journey-card\" href=\"https://woodexfurniture.pk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><figure class=\"hm-journey-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Custom Woodex kitchen cabinetry and joinery\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"hm-journey-body\"><small>Woodex Furniture™</small><h3>Finish the space with pieces made for it.</h3><p>Custom kitchens, wardrobes, workstations and fitted storage.</p><span class=\"hm-journey-link\">Explore service →</span></div></a>\n      </div></div><div class=\"hm-controls\" aria-label=\"Services carousel controls\"><span class=\"hm-status\" id=\"hm-journey-status\" aria-live=\"polite\">01 / 06</span><button class=\"hm-control\" id=\"hm-journey-prev\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous services\" disabled=\"\">←</button><button class=\"hm-control\" id=\"hm-journey-next\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next services\">→</button></div></div>\n    </div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "906b2c8b08",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hm-section hm-projects\" id=\"home-projects\"><div class=\"hm-wrap\">\n      <header class=\"hm-section-head\" data-home-reveal=\"\"><div><p class=\"hm-kicker\">Selected studies</p><h2>Studies and rooms drawn so they can be built</h2></div><p>Project photography will be added as it is supplied. These studies show the range Woodex develops and delivers.</p></header>\n      <div class=\"hm-project-grid\" data-home-reveal=\"\">\n        <figure class=\"hm-project\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-dce06249b137.webp\" alt=\"Contemporary residence exterior study at dusk\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"><figcaption><small>Residential architecture</small><strong>Contemporary home study</strong></figcaption></figure>\n        <figure class=\"hm-project\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" alt=\"Contemporary office interior study with workstations\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"><figcaption><small>Office fit-out</small><strong>Workplace planning study</strong></figcaption></figure>\n        <figure class=\"hm-project\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Retail showroom interior visualization study\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"><figcaption><small>Retail interior</small><strong>Showroom study</strong></figcaption></figure>\n      </div><div class=\"hm-projects-foot\"><a class=\"hm-btn hm-btn-light\" href=\"/projects/\">View projects</a></div>\n    </div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "9eecedd598",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hm-section hm-about\" id=\"home-about\"><div class=\"hm-wrap hm-about-grid\">\n      <figure class=\"hm-about-media\" data-home-reveal=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-dce06249b137.webp\" alt=\"Contemporary completed residence representing Woodex design and delivery\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"><span class=\"hm-about-inset\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Custom kitchen joinery detail\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></span></figure>\n      <div class=\"hm-about-copy\" data-home-reveal=\"\"><p class=\"hm-kicker\">One brief. One standard. One accountable team.</p><h2>Design clarity, material warmth and precise delivery</h2><p>Woodex Interior has worked from Lahore since 2016, bringing architecture, interior design, fit-out, renovation, visualization and custom furniture into one connected practice.</p><a class=\"hm-btn\" href=\"/about/\" data-page-route=\"about\">More about us</a></div>\n    </div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "a214904ef0",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hm-section hm-insights\" id=\"home-insights\"><div class=\"hm-wrap\">\n      <header class=\"hm-section-head\" data-home-reveal=\"\"><div><p class=\"hm-kicker\">From the studio</p><h2>Ideas for better spaces</h2></div><a class=\"hm-btn\" href=\"/insights/\">View insights</a></header>\n      <div class=\"hm-article-grid\" data-home-reveal=\"\">\n        <article class=\"hm-article\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-c349a92a4ae0.webp\" alt=\"Warm living room interior with layered lighting\" width=\"2240\" height=\"1120\"></figure><div class=\"hm-article-copy\"><small>Planning</small><h3>How to build a clear interior brief</h3><p>Start with the operation, the people and the daily decisions the room must support.</p></div></article>\n        <article class=\"hm-article\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Custom kitchen cabinetry and storage detail\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"hm-article-copy\"><small>Materials</small><h3>Choosing finishes that age with character</h3><p>Look beyond the sample and consider touch, cleaning, repair and how the material meets its neighbours.</p></div></article>\n        <article class=\"hm-article\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" alt=\"Office interior with focused work and meeting areas\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"hm-article-copy\"><small>Fit-out</small><h3>What a useful fit-out brief should include</h3><p>Team size, flow, services, access and a realistic handover date make the first estimate stronger.</p></div></article>\n      </div>\n    </div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "b4ee1f0d5a",
  "type": "faq",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"hm-section hm-faq\" id=\"home-faq\"><div class=\"hm-wrap hm-faq-grid\">\n      <div class=\"hm-faq-side\" data-home-reveal=\"\"><p class=\"hm-kicker\">Common questions</p><h2>Clear answers before the work begins</h2><a class=\"hm-btn\" href=\"#home-faq-list\">View FAQs</a><figure class=\"hm-faq-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" alt=\"Contemporary Woodex office study accompanying project questions\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure></div>\n      <div class=\"hm-faq-list\" id=\"home-faq-list\" data-home-reveal=\"\">\n        <div class=\"hm-faq-item\"><button class=\"hm-faq-q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><span>What services does Woodex Interior provide?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"hm-faq-a\"><div><p>Interior design, fit-out, renovation, architecture, 3D visualization and custom furniture, coordinated from our Lahore studio.</p></div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"hm-faq-item\"><button class=\"hm-faq-q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>Can Woodex manage a project from design to handover?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"hm-faq-a\"><div><p>Yes. You can appoint one service or ask one team to coordinate the design, quantities, build, furniture and final handover.</p></div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"hm-faq-item\"><button class=\"hm-faq-q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>Does Woodex only work in Lahore?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"hm-faq-a\"><div><p>Lahore is our base. We also support selected projects in Islamabad, Karachi and other cities across Pakistan.</p></div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"hm-faq-item\"><button class=\"hm-faq-q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>How do we begin a project?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"hm-faq-a\"><div><p>Share the location, approximate area, intended use, timeline and any drawings you already have. We will confirm the right next step.</p></div></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></section>",
  "fields": {
   "heading": "Clear answers before the work begins",
   "items": [
    {
     "q": "What services does Woodex Interior provide?",
     "a": "<p>Interior design, fit-out, renovation, architecture, 3D visualization and custom furniture, coordinated from our Lahore studio.</p>"
    },
    {
     "q": "Can Woodex manage a project from design to handover?",
     "a": "<p>Yes. You can appoint one service or ask one team to coordinate the design, quantities, build, furniture and final handover.</p>"
    },
    {
     "q": "Does Woodex only work in Lahore?",
     "a": "<p>Lahore is our base. We also support selected projects in Islamabad, Karachi and other cities across Pakistan.</p>"
    },
    {
     "q": "How do we begin a project?",
     "a": "<p>Share the location, approximate area, intended use, timeline and any drawings you already have. We will confirm the right next step.</p>"
    }
   ]
  }
 },
